# Exclude build artefacts and editor noise from the Docker context. The
# fewer bytes Docker sends to its daemon, the faster the build.

/target
**/target/
crates/paddock-fuzz/corpus
crates/paddock-fuzz/artifacts
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
results/
flamegraph*.svg
perf.data*
*.profraw
